title: Hevenu Shalom Aleichem
artist: Traditional
origin: Israel
culture: Jewish
genre: Celebration
language: he
key: E minor
tempo: 126
meter: 4/4
pickup: 1.5
intro: 2
outro: 1
style: klezmer
guide: clarinet
year: 1920
attribution: Anonymous Hasidic melody (in circulation in Europe by about 1920, when Franz Xaver Haberl quoted it in a printed march); the only words are the traditional Hebrew greeting "We brought peace upon you". No known author, public domain. Sung three times through, as is usual.
source_url: https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Hevenu_shalom_aleichem&action=raw
beginner: yes
tags: jewish, hebrew, peace, celebration, wedding, hora

